  "label": "Swedish women are mapped onto the five women in swimsuits",
  "description": "The top text 'all those in favour of bringing swedish women to america as refugees' explicitly refers to 'swedish women' as the preferred group. The visual material, 'five_women', is directly mapped onto this textual entity, implying that these idealized, attractive women represent the 'Swedish women' being advocated for in the text. This is an analogical mapping where the visual representation of attractive Western women is used to stand in for the concept of 'Swedish women' as refugees.",
